{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860204922654163014","content":"Now that Ive posted that, do not discuss what we talk about here in open chat.  You can say how you look, people can try to figure it out, but this is a process that is more fun the less they know.\n\nSo what will happen is you will roll 4 d20... and in order it will determine Your Major Damnation Benefit, Major Damnation Detriment, Minor Damnation Benefit, Minor Damnation Detriment.  I want you to look at these changes as role play opportunity.  Also If a change really doesn't work for your character, we can discuss possibly re-rolling.  You will become immune to the levels of damnation, and any body you end up in will have the same Damnations.  With that said, you may in the future have your mutations shift at DM's discretion (do not ask for this), but we will always try to work with you to make it work with your character.","created_at":"2021-07-14T03:28:49.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864709999292055612","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
